# Mapbox public token for the Commute & safety zone map.
# Create one at https://account.mapbox.com/access-tokens/ -- it starts with "pk.".
#
# This one DOES reach the browser (that is what a public token is for), so
# restrict it by URL in the Mapbox dashboard. It is a different key from the
# Google one in ../spike/.env, which is server-side and must never be exposed.
VITE_MAPBOX_TOKEN=
